sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Dictyostelium discoideum Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 2.304 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — MorphoEval overall 86.5/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 keeps the same Schnakenberg integrator. The discrete-Laplacian peak is 2.303721 µm against the catalog coordinate 2.304 µm. On 23 unstable Fourier modes, measured growth versus linear theory has Pearson r = 0.9999999973, RMSE = 3.668e-05 /s, and KS = 0.0870. Raising δ = Dv/Du from 14 to 64, with Du fixed, moves λ from 2.053 µm to 2.847 µm and is monotonic; δ <= 12 has σ_max < 0. Equal diffusion drops var(u) by about 3.8e-05 of its initial value while δ=24 raises var(u) by about 247×. The sorocarp mask has foreground fraction 0.181, circularity 0.096, coherency 0.580, none equal to the reference placeholders. GIF CV similarity against that photograph is 83.2 (12 frames, 960×720). The photograph remains a fruiting body, not a 2.3 µm cortical frame. Overall 86.5/100 (faithfulness 85.1, reproducibility 89.6); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d; environment: python 3.12.3, numpy 2.5.4, scipy 1.18.1, matplotlib 3.11.2, pillow 13.0.0. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 90, Morphological realism / specimen match 76, Parameter expressivity 88, Morphometric validation 92, Source and data traceability 92, Code-to-model traceability 86, Reproducibility package 90. Output judged: docs/media/dictyostelium_discoideum_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d, image/png, 292818 B, 1584×984 px, artifact_sha256 bac77ec104f165d2016729fc8ed5760b374a6e3b832ae85a3aa36ecf78caaba4 (sha256 bac77ec104f165d2016729fc8ed5760b374a6e3b832ae85a3aa36ecf78caaba4), spec_fingerprint 960dc004eb4baeba25b2cb4a7d5ced2a0307317641afcb7da587f46f715075d8. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 960dc004eb4baeba25b2cb4a7d5ced2a0307317641afcb7da587f46f715075d8; artifact_sha256: bac77ec104f165d2016729fc8ed5760b374a6e3b832ae85a3aa36ecf78caaba4; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/dictyostelium_discoideum_turing_wavelength_s0/dictyostelium_discoideum_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=b4d3f1e6feedaad3..., datasets/dictyostelium_discoideum_turing_wavelength_s0/dictyostelium_discoideum_turing_wavelength_s0_specimen.jpg=e2d2b739211bda97...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-dictyostelium-discoideum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952: diffusion-driven instability at a finite critical wavenumber. | Schnakenberg 1979: trimolecular kinetics used as the carrier of k_c. | Taniguchi 2013 and Bretschneider 2009: Dictyostelium cortical actin/PIP3 waves are a few-micrometre excitable pattern. | Höfer 1995 and Sawai 2005: extracellular cAMP organizes millimetre-scale aggregation.; reconstructed_in_script: Periodic Schnakenberg PDE, discrete-Laplacian dispersion, δ sweep, equal-diffusion ablation, and border-contrast segmentation of the vendored sorocarp.; transfer_boundary: 2.304 µm (2.304e-06 m, log10=-5.638, tier 3_subcellular_um, detail) is the slot coordinate. Age is 0 Ma, chronoseries 1/1. | A 200 nm predecessor regime admits N=0. A 1 mm aggregation successor is a longer wavelength of the same extant species.; does_not_claim: That a paper measured λ = 2.304 µm. | That the sorocarp silhouette is the cortical Turing field. | That Taniguchi phase singularities or mass-conserving Brauns–Frey kinetics were integrated. | That the Lean file was checked by the Lean kernel; lean was not installed.." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: R-assessor: still a single builder-assessor. No second provider scored Pass 2.",
            "remediation needed: R-lean: the four theorems use decide on closed Int goals and contain no sorry, but lean was not installed, so the kernel did not check them.",
            "remediation needed: R-scale: 2.304 µm remains the catalog coordinate. A cortical micrograph at that scale was not vendored; the public-domain image is a sorocarp." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.865"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (builder-assessor, single agent; second assessor still open)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> .
}

